    "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\n#40581 relaxes the contract, allowing optional trailing opts params in API functions.\r\nHowever, API functions with optional trailing opts params throw an `E119: Not enough arguments for function` error when called from Vimscript.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nAdd a min/max argument range in the Vimscript generator if the function has an `opts_idx` field.\r\n\r\n## See also\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/42142#issuecomment-5894520431",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-30T21:24:05Z",
